pass in quick proto tcp from any to any port = ssh flags S/SA keep state label "ssh"
block drop in log quick from <jaildeck_test_blocked> to any label "blocked-sources"
pass out log quick proto icmp all keep state label "icmp-out-logged"
pass out all flags S/SA keep state label "outbound"
pass in all flags S/SA keep state
anchor "jaildeck/*" all
anchor "operator" all
